<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Extras on Sampalu</title><link>https://sampalu.github.io/guia-de-estudos/fundamentos/extras/</link><description>Recent content in Extras on Sampalu</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://sampalu.github.io/guia-de-estudos/fundamentos/extras/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Herança x Composição</title><link>https://sampalu.github.io/guia-de-estudos/fundamentos/extras/heranca-x-composicao/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://sampalu.github.io/guia-de-estudos/fundamentos/extras/heranca-x-composicao/</guid><description>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Herança&lt;/strong>: estabelece uma relação &lt;strong>&amp;ldquo;é um&amp;rdquo;&lt;/strong> (exemplo: um &lt;strong>Cachorro&lt;/strong> é um &lt;strong>Animal&lt;/strong>). A classe filha herda atributos e comportamentos da classe pai.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Composição&lt;/strong>: estabelece uma relação &lt;strong>&amp;ldquo;tem um&amp;rdquo;&lt;/strong> (exemplo: um &lt;strong>Carro&lt;/strong> tem um &lt;strong>Motor&lt;/strong>). Um objeto contém outro como parte de sua estrutura.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;hr>
&lt;h3 id="exemplo-de-herança">&lt;strong>Exemplo de Herança&lt;/strong>&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#exemplo-de-heran%c3%a7a" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h3>
&lt;p>Na herança, uma classe filha herda de uma classe base e pode sobrescrever métodos.&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="background-color:#f8f8f8;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-csharp" data-lang="csharp">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#204a87;font-weight:bold">using&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#000">System&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#8f5902;font-style:italic">// Classe base&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#204a87;font-weight:bold">public&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#204a87;font-weight:bold">class&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#000">Animal&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#204a87;font-weight:bold">public&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#204a87;font-weight:bold">string&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#000">Nome&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">{&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#204a87;font-weight:bold">get&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">;&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#204a87;font-weight:bold">set&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">;&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#204a87;font-weight:bold">public&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#204a87;font-weight:bold">void&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#000">EmitirSom&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">()&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#000">Console&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">.&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#000">WriteLine&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">(&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#4e9a06">&amp;#34;O animal emitiu um som.&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#8f5902;font-style:italic">// Classe derivada (herda de Animal)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#204a87;font-weight:bold">public&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#204a87;font-weight:bold">class&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#000">Cachorro&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">:&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#000">Animal&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#204a87;font-weight:bold">public&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#204a87;font-weight:bold">void&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#000">Latir&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">()&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#000">Console&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">.&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#000">WriteLine&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">(&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#4e9a06">$&amp;#34;{Nome} está latindo: Au Au!&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#204a87;font-weight:bold">class&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#000">Program&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#204a87;font-weight:bold">static&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#204a87;font-weight:bold">void&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#000">Main&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">()&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#000">Cachorro&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#000">dog&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">=&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#204a87;font-weight:bold">new&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#000">Cachorro&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">{&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#000">Nome&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">=&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#4e9a06">&amp;#34;Rex&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">};&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#000">dog&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">.&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#000">EmitirSom&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">();&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#8f5902;font-style:italic">// Método herdado da classe Animal&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#000">dog&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">.&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#000">Latir&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">();&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#8f5902;font-style:italic">// Método específico do Cachorro&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#000;font-weight:bold">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>&lt;strong>✔ Vantagens:&lt;/strong> Reutiliza código da classe base.&lt;br>
&lt;strong>❌ Desvantagens:&lt;/strong> Pode levar a uma hierarquia rígida e difícil de modificar.&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>